<title>PORTUGAL: BANK/PORTUGAL SETS 30 BLN ESC VARIABLE REPO.</title>
<headline>BANK/PORTUGAL SETS 30 BLN ESC VARIABLE REPO.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said offered a 30 billion escudo, variable-rate repurchase pact and left its fixed rates unchanged on Monday for the start of a new commercial bank reserve period.</p>
<p>Bids for the funds must be received by 1415 GMT.</p>
<p>The absorption rate was unchanged at 5.4 percent.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
